<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Entry Form Locked</title>
  <style>
    :root { --navy: #102d5a; --blue: #1d4ed8; --muted: #64748b; --line: #dbe3ee; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 20px; color: #172033; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eaf0f8, #f8fafc 55%, #e8f4f2); }
    .card { width: min(560px, 100%); padding: 34px 28px; text-align: center; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(15, 36, 72, .14); }
    .lock-icon { width: 78px; height: 78px; display: grid; place-items: center; margin: 0 auto 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; font-size: 42px; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.5rem; } .message { margin: 0 auto 20px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .details { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin: 20px 0; padding: 15px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; background: #f8fafc; font-size: .9rem; }
    .details strong { color: var(--navy); } .dates { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; }
    .home-btn { display: inline-block; padding: 11px 22px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--navy); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; } .home-btn:hover { background: #1e477e; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card" role="alert">
    <div class="lock-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128274;</div>
    <h1>Entry Form Currently Locked</h1>
    <p class="message">This entry form is not open at the moment. Please contact your Coordinator for assistance or to request access.</p>
    <div class="details">
      <div><strong>Subject:</strong> <%= subject || '-' %></div>
      <div><strong>Class:</strong> <%= studentClass || '-' %></div>
      <div><strong>Section:</strong> <%= section || '-' %></div>
      <div><strong>Terminal:</strong> <%= terminal || '-' %></div>
      <div><strong>Academic Year:</strong> <%= academicYear || '-' %></div>
      <div class="dates"><strong>Form open:</strong> <%= fromDate || '-' %> to <%= toDate || '-' %> (BS)</div>
    </div>
    <a class="home-btn" href="/">Go to Home</a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
